msgid "The diagnosis has not been run yet. Nothing is sent to the Nurevo service until you run it."
msgstr "Diagnostika ešte nebola spustená. Kým ju nespustíte, do služby Nurevo sa nič neodosiela."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:5233
