msgstr "Diagnostika nebola spustená a nič sa neodoslalo. Kedykoľvek ju môžete spustiť na obrazovke Skóre AEO."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/includes/setup-wizard.php:915
msgid "The diagnosis is run by the Nurevo service at nurevo.jp. It sends your home page URL and WordPress language; the service then reads your public front page, robots.txt and llms.txt. Nothing is sent unless you tick this box."
msgstr "Diagnostiku vykonáva služba Nurevo na nurevo.jp. Odošle sa URL vašej domovskej stránky a jazyk WordPressu; služba potom prečíta vašu verejnú úvodnú stránku, robots.txt a llms.txt. Bez zaškrtnutia tohto políčka sa nič neodošle."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3875
msgid "The diagnosis is run by the Nurevo service at nurevo.jp. Nothing has been sent yet: the plugin contacts the service only after you agree here."
msgstr "Diagnostiku vykonáva služba Nurevo na nurevo.jp. Zatiaľ sa nič neodoslalo: plugin kontaktuje službu až po vašom súhlase tu."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/includes/cli.php:78
msgid "The diagnosis sends this site’s URL to the Nurevo service. Run again with --consent to agree."
msgstr "Diagnostika odošle URL tohto webu do služby Nurevo. Ak súhlasíte, spustite príkaz znova s --consent."

